# The positive half of the-irencrag-named-everflame-shares-no-name-with-a-second-irencrag. The first Irencrag became
# Everflame, Heroes' Legacy as Aunt May entered on turn 1, and lost its trigger with its other abilities: when
# Belladonna Took, legendary, enters on turn 3, only the second Irencrag's ability triggers, with Aunt May's life gain
# beside it (two items on the stack). Bot1 accepts, and now both are legendary permanents named Everflame, Heroes' Legacy (CR 612.8), so the legend rule
# (CR 704.5j) has Bot1 keep one: the other goes to the graveyard, where it is The Irencrag again (CR 400.7).

